Feature: bira context

  Background:
    Given I run "bira init --name test-project"

  Scenario: Context shows project summary after init
    When I run "bira context"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "test-project"
    And output contains "Open tasks:"

  Scenario: Context --json returns structured output
    When I run "bira context --json"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output as JSON at path "$.project_name" equals "test-project"
    And output as JSON at path "$.open_task_count" exists

  Scenario: Context --full shows feature breakdown
    When I run "bira context --full"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "test-project"
    And output contains "backlog"
    And output contains "Ready:"

  Scenario: Context --full --json shows features array
    When I run "bira context --full --json"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output as JSON at path "$.features" exists
    And output as JSON at path "$.features[0].is_backlog" equals true
